# What `docker build -f tool/server/Dockerfile .` leaves out of the context
# (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile). The build
# needs the root pubspec, lib/ is not compiled but the workspace members are
# resolved, so packages/ stays; outputs, caches and platform folders go.
.git
.dart_tool
**/.dart_tool
build
**/build
android
ios
macos
windows
linux
web
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/key.properties
**/.env*
**/service-account*.json
